        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Apartment 51, King’s Court, Parnell Street, Dublin 1, D01 CF21\r\n€3,200 per month | 2 Bed | 1 Bath | Furnished | Available Immediately\r\nStokes Property are delighted to present this bright and well-presented two-bedroom, fourth-floor apartment to the rental market. The property is presented in excellent condition throughout and enjoys a highly convenient city-centre location.\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, spacious open-plan living/dining room with timber flooring, and a contemporary fitted kitchen with a range of appliances. There are two well-proportioned bedrooms, including a main double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, together with a modern, fully tiled shower room.\r\nKing’s Court is ideally positioned on Parnell Street, within easy walking distance of O’Connell Street, Henry Street and the wider city centre. The area is exceptionally well served by the Luas, Dublin Bus and other transport links."
      },
